{
  "_readme": [
    "Build manifest for the standalone native unit tests (tests/test_*.cpp) and the",
    "diagnostic tools (tests/tools/*.cpp). Built by tests/build-native.mjs; the",
    "cpp-unit lane (scripts/run-native-unit-tests.mjs) requires every test_*.cpp here.",
    "Every target compiles tests/<name>.cpp (tools: tests/tools/<name>.cpp) plus",
    "`sources`, with /W3 /WX and /I src. `uses`: dxsdk = DirectX SDK include + lib",
    "path; expat = expat headers + XML_STATIC/XML_UNICODE_WCHAR_T; expat-lib = expat",
    "plus the prebuilt expatw_static.lib; webview2 = WebView2 NuGet headers.",
    "`release: true` adds an /O2 /DNDEBUG pass (tests/<name>.release.exe) so the",
    "shipped parser's no-assert behaviour is exercised too."
  ],
